{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "Shared tag-rename mapping cases for Rust (authoritative) and TypeScript. Name normalization: strip leading/trailing Unicode White_Space characters (Rust str::trim; this does NOT strip U+FEFF), then Unicode default lowercase. Exact mode: errors empty-source, empty-destination, unchanged. Prefix mode: normalize, remove exactly one trailing colon (no re-trim), then errors empty-source, empty-destination, multi-segment-prefix (a colon remains), unchanged. Error precedence: source empty is reported before destination empty; cases never combine different error kinds. Tag mapping: normalize each tag; exact renames a tag equal to source; prefix renames tags starting with source+':' keeping the whole remainder (a plain tag equal to source is not renamed). An entry is a target iff any normalized tag maps; targets output normalize_tags (trim, lowercase, drop empties, sort bytewise, dedup); non-targets output the input untouched. duplicatesCollapsed = distinct non-empty normalized input tags minus output tags for targets, else 0. No tag case mixes astral characters with U+E000..U+FFFF, so UTF-8 byte order and UTF-16 order agree. Cases whose lowercase result depends on Unicode context (final sigma, dotted capital I, astral Deseret) must be re-checked against Rust to_lowercase in the Rust test.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "exact-basic",
      "mode": "exact",
      "source": "Status",
      "destination": "State",
      "expected": {
        "mapping": {
          "mode": "exact",
          "source": "status",
          "destination": "state"
        }
      },
      "tags": [
        {
          "input": [
            "Status",
            "x"
          ],
          "target": true,
          "output": [
            "state",
            "x"
          ],
          "duplicatesCollapsed": 0
        },
        {
          "input": [
            "status:printed",
            "status"
          ],
          "target": true,
          "output": [
            "state",
            "status:printed"
          ],
          "duplicatesCollapsed": 0
        },
        {
          "input": [
            "color:red",
            "x"
          ],
          "target": false,
          "output": [
            "color:red",
            "x"
          ],
          "duplicatesCollapsed": 0
        },
        {
          "input": [
            " Z ",
            "a"
          ],
          "target": false,
          "output": [
            " Z ",
            "a"
          ],
          "duplicatesCollapsed": 0
        },
        {
          "input": [],
          "target": false,
          "output": [],
          "duplicatesCollapsed": 0
        }
      ]
    },
